From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amaan Qureshi <git@amaanq.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] add edge swipe navigation setting

Add a 3-option setting for edge swipe navigation in Accessibility settings:
- Disabled: No edge swipe navigation
- Back only: Left edge swipe goes back (default Chrome behavior)
- Back & Forward: Left edge = back, Right edge = forward

This provides better UX than a simple toggle or chrome://flags.
